==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Nidoran♂|57}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Peck}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Nidoran♂}} can learn.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Nidoran♂}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

